* VT100DYN - TERMINAL SUPPORT LOADER

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* VT100DYN - TERMINAL SUPPORT LOADER

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    A0:VT100DYN [N]

Loads/configures the supplied VT100 terminal support for CP/M 3. The
optional N form requests nonresident operation. Terminal dimensions and
control sequences must match the active terminal.

This is private startup/maintenance support, not an ordinary caller
command. Retain the supplied configuration unless testing a different
terminal on copied disks.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
